<title>UK: Allied H1 pretax falls on strong stg.</title>
<headline>Allied H1 pretax falls on strong stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to February 28</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		19.4		   vs 19.2</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 9.44		   vs 9.44</p>
<p> Pretax		     317		    vs 321</p>
<p> Turnover		   2,319		  vs 2,795</p>
<p>NOTE - Above profit figures normalised at actual exchange rates. At level exchange rates, pretax profit was 317 million stg versus 307 million stg.</p>
<p>The company said currency translation hurt pretax profits by about 14 million stg in the current H1.</p>
<p>Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 308.0 and 319.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Allied Domecq Plc --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
